s6-4-p9 : Block
s6-4-p9 = prose (cons "A source-to-source projection is itself a function. If an extension introduces a new notation, the notation can elaborate to ordinary source constructs, with the elaboration law proved by induction on its syntax. If an annotation has no runtime meaning, erasing it is the first projection of a dependent pair. If an extension changes runtime meaning, the translation explicitly defines the changed source expression. These are ordinary cases of construction and interpretation." nil)
